%% SADITA.ai — Sequence Diagram Global
%% Alur lengkap dari setup hingga penilaian

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant ADM as 🛡️ Admin
    participant KPD as 👨‍🏫 Kaprodi
    participant DSN as 👩‍🏫 Dosen
    participant KTK as 🎖️ Ketua Kelas
    participant MHS as 🎒 Mahasiswa
    participant FE as 🌐 Frontend
    participant BE as ⚙️ Backend API
    participant DB as 🗄️ PostgreSQL
    participant MQTT as 📡 MQTT Broker
    participant ESP as 📟 ESP32 Device

    Note over ADM, DB: ═══ FASE 1: SETUP SISTEM (Admin) ═══

    ADM->>FE: Login sebagai Admin
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/auth/login
    BE->>DB: Validasi kredensial
    DB-->>BE: User data + role ADMIN
    BE-->>FE: JWT Token
    FE-->>ADM: Redirect → /admin/dashboard

    ADM->>FE: Kelola Program Studi, Semester, Mata Kuliah
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/academic/terms
    BE->>DB: Insert AcademicTerm
    ADM->>FE: Buat Kelas Perkuliahan
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/academic/classes
    BE->>DB: Insert CourseClass (dengan Dosen & Jadwal)
    ADM->>FE: Daftarkan Mahasiswa ke Kelas
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/academic/classes/{id}/enroll
    BE->>DB: Insert ClassEnrollment
    ADM->>FE: Tugaskan Ketua Kelas
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/workflow/class-leaders
    BE->>DB: Insert ClassLeaderAssignment
    ADM->>FE: Daftarkan Perangkat IoT
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/devices
    BE->>DB: Insert SaditaDevice

    Note over KPD, DB: ═══ FASE 2: MONITORING PRODI (Kaprodi) ═══

    KPD->>FE: Login sebagai Kaprodi
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/auth/login
    BE-->>FE: JWT Token (role KAPRODI)
    FE-->>KPD: Redirect → /kaprodi/dashboard
    KPD->>FE: Lihat data dosen & mahasiswa prodi
    FE->>BE: GET /api/v1/students (filtered by prodi)
    BE->>DB: Query StudentProfile WHERE prodi_id = X
    DB-->>BE: List mahasiswa prodi
    BE-->>FE: Data mahasiswa
    KPD->>FE: Monitor presensi prodi
    FE->>BE: GET /api/v1/attendance/sessions
    BE-->>FE: Ringkasan presensi

    Note over DSN, DB: ═══ FASE 3: PERSIAPAN PEMBELAJARAN (Dosen) ═══

    DSN->>FE: Login sebagai Dosen
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/auth/login
    BE-->>FE: JWT Token (role DOSEN)
    FE-->>DSN: Redirect → /dosen/dashboard

    DSN->>FE: Buat Chapter & Lesson
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/lms/classes/{id}/chapters
    BE->>DB: Insert CourseChapter
    DSN->>FE: Upload Materi
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/lms/materials
    BE->>DB: Insert CourseMaterial
    DSN->>FE: Buat Tugas
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/lms/assignments
    BE->>DB: Insert Assignment (dengan due_date)
    DSN->>FE: Buat Kuis
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/lms/quizzes
    BE->>DB: Insert Quiz + QuizQuestion + QuizOption

    Note over DSN, ESP: ═══ FASE 4: SESI PRESENSI ═══

    DSN->>FE: Buka Sesi Presensi Pertemuan ke-N
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/attendance/sessions
    BE->>DB: Insert AttendanceSession (OPEN)
    BE->>MQTT: Publish session info ke device

    MHS->>ESP: Tap KTM (RFID)
    ESP->>MQTT: Publish tap event (UID + device_id)
    MQTT->>BE: Subscribe & receive tap
    BE->>DB: Lookup RfidCredential by UID
    BE->>DB: Validate enrollment + session status
    BE->>DB: Insert AttendanceRecord (HADIR/TERLAMBAT)
    BE->>DB: Insert AttendanceEvent (audit trail)
    BE->>MQTT: Publish feedback (OK/REJECT)
    MQTT->>ESP: Tampilkan feedback di LCD
    ESP-->>MHS: LCD: "Presensi Berhasil ✅"

    DSN->>FE: Tutup Sesi Presensi
    FE->>BE: PATCH /api/v1/attendance/sessions/{id}/close
    BE->>DB: Update session status → CLOSED

    Note over KTK, DB: ═══ FASE 5: MONITORING KETUA KELAS ═══

    KTK->>FE: Login sebagai Ketua Kelas
    FE-->>KTK: Redirect → /ketua-kelas/dashboard
    KTK->>FE: Lihat daftar rekan & presensi kelas
    FE->>BE: GET /api/v1/attendance/sessions/{id}/records
    BE->>DB: Query records WHERE class_id = assigned_class
    BE-->>FE: Data presensi kelas
    KTK->>FE: Ajukan presensi online (jika diizinkan)
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/workflow/attendance-requests
    BE->>DB: Insert AttendanceRequest (PENDING)

    Note over MHS, DB: ═══ FASE 6: AKTIVITAS PEMBELAJARAN (Mahasiswa) ═══

    MHS->>FE: Login sebagai Mahasiswa
    FE-->>MHS: Redirect → /mahasiswa/dashboard
    MHS->>FE: Akses Materi Pembelajaran
    FE->>BE: GET /api/v1/lms/classes/{id}/materials
    BE->>DB: Query CourseMaterial WHERE class_id IN enrolled
    BE-->>FE: List materi
    MHS->>FE: Kumpulkan Tugas
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/lms/assignments/{id}/submit
    BE->>DB: Insert AssignmentSubmission
    MHS->>FE: Kerjakan Kuis
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/lms/quizzes/{id}/submit
    BE->>DB: Grade answers server-side
    BE->>DB: Insert QuizSubmission + QuizAnswer

    Note over DSN, DB: ═══ FASE 7: PENILAIAN (Dosen) ═══

    DSN->>FE: Lihat & Nilai Submission
    FE->>BE: GET /api/v1/lms/assignments/{id}/submissions
    BE-->>FE: List submissions
    DSN->>FE: Berikan Nilai & Feedback
    FE->>BE: PATCH /api/v1/lms/submissions/{id}/grade
    BE->>DB: Update AssignmentSubmission (score, feedback)
    DSN->>FE: Input Nilai Akhir
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/lms/grades
    BE->>DB: Upsert StudentGrade (UTS, UAS, Tugas, Absen, Aktif)
    BE->>DB: Calculate final_score & grade_scale

    MHS->>FE: Lihat Nilai/KHS
    FE->>BE: GET /api/v1/lms/grades/my
    BE->>DB: Query StudentGrade WHERE student_id = current
    BE-->>FE: Data KHS
    FE-->>MHS: Tampilkan Nilai

    Note over ADM, DB: ═══ FASE 8: AUDIT & MONITORING ═══

    ADM->>FE: Lihat Audit Log
    FE->>BE: GET /api/v1/audit/logs
    BE->>DB: Query AuditLog
    BE-->>FE: Log aktivitas sistem
